---
import Button from '@components/ui/Button.astro';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 border border-amber-300 mb-3">
        Highlands County Seller Advantage
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1b3a5c] mb-4">
        Why Sellers Choose Alyson
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-sans">
        Selling a home in Sebring requires nuanced local market insight, disciplined pricing, and aggressive buyer outreach. Here is how Alyson delivers top-dollar results for Highlands County homeowners.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- Benefit 1: Expert Pricing Strategy -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-stone-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#1b3a5c]/10 text-[#1b3a5c] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">
            📊
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#1b3a5c] mb-3">
            Expert Pricing Strategy
          </h3>
          <p class="text-stone-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Automated online algorithms cannot account for Highlands County's unique micro-markets, lot configurations, or 55+ community amenities. Alyson performs a granular Comparative Market Analysis (CMA) analyzing recent verified sales in your specific subdivision—from Tanglewood to Golf Hammock—to position your home at peak market value without risking costly days on market.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8A4700] uppercase tracking-wider">
            ✓ Accurate valuation · Maximized equity
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 2: Maximum Market Exposure -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-stone-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#1b3a5c]/10 text-[#1b3a5c] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">
            🌐
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#1b3a5c] mb-3">
            Maximum Market Exposure
          </h3>
          <p class="text-stone-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Every listing receives comprehensive marketing designed to captivate active buyers across Florida and out-of-state relocations. Your property benefits from high-definition HDR photography, compelling lifestyle copy, full MLS syndication, and targeted digital promotion that drives qualified inquiries directly to your front door.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8A4700] uppercase tracking-wider">
            ✓ HDR visual media · Multi-platform reach
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 3: Personal Attention & Communication -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 border border-stone-200 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-[#1b3a5c]/10 text-[#1b3a5c] flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 font-bold" aria-hidden="true">
            🤝
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-[#1b3a5c] mb-3">
            Personal Attention & Communication
          </h3>
          <p class="text-stone-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-4">
            You deserve a dedicated real estate partner, not a revolving team of junior associates. When you list with Alyson, you work directly with her from the initial pre-listing consultation, through open houses and showings, to rigorous contract negotiations and closing day. You receive consistent updates every step of the journey.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-100">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#8A4700] uppercase tracking-wider">
            ✓ Direct representation · Zero hand-offs
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section CTA -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <Button href="/sell-my-home-sebring-fl/" variant="primary" size="md">
        Learn More About Selling in Sebring →
      </Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
